    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L16-ACTIVITY-012",
      "SourceSection": "16.3: Calculating Surface Area",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Write an equation for \\(S\\) as a function of \\(r\\) when the volume of the cylinder is 452 cm3.",
